WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.812
You already have a great QA team. So why bring in someone like me? Because testing AI is a completely different animal.

00:06.812 --> 00:19.572
Your QA team tests deterministic software: same input, same output, every time. AI isn't deterministic — the same prompt can give a different answer tomorrow. Traditional test cases can't catch that.

00:19.572 --> 00:30.846
I bring the AI-specific layer: evaluations, judge models, drift detection, retrieval scoring. I don't replace your QA team — I give them the tools to test the part they can't.

00:30.846 --> 00:35.526
Your team keeps owning quality. I just make quality measurable for the AI.

00:35.526 --> 00:38.805
Add the missing layer, not another headcount. Let's talk.

